      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِخْنَقَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A necklace,</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِلَادَةٌ</span>, (S, Mgh, Msb,
K,) <i>that surrounds the neck;</i> (Mgh, Msb;) wherefore it is thus called; (Msb;) [i. e., because] <i>it
lies against the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُخَنَّق</span>: pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَخَانِقُ</span>. (TA.) ― 
